{
  "about": "What the composer sends for a draft. A draft is HTML from the Matrix spec's tag list, the way the composer stores it. body is the event's plain body, html its formatted_body or null when nothing is formatted, mentions the user IDs for m.mentions, sorted, and mentionsRoom whether it notifies the room. A mention is a matrix.to link to a user, or a complete user ID typed outside code; @room typed outside code notifies the room.",
